{"name": "Yomi no Kuni", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Art of Marks</strong> <br/> Combat is fast-paced, melee-focused, and unforgiving. Apply Marks to enemies with each strike and find the perfect opening to detonate them in devastating combos, shattering defenses and carving your way through the hordes of the underworld.  <br/> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103600/extras/b0cfb3e009c318b7335abaa48c44a1ce.poster.avif?t=1786569085\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103600/extras/b0cfb3e009c318b7335abaa48c44a1ce.webm?t=1786569085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103600/extras/b0cfb3e009c318b7335abaa48c44a1ce.mp4?t=1786569085\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Entities of the Abyss</strong> <br/>The end of each descent is guarded by twisted abominations and colossal forms. Face brutal bosses that will demand precise reflexes and absolute mastery of your mechanics to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103600/extras/4095f66fd1e7e26b01bc11727945acff.poster.avif?t=1786569085\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103600/extras/4095f66fd1e7e26b01bc11727945acff.webm?t=1786569085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103600/extras/4095f66fd1e7e26b01bc11727945acff.mp4?t=1786569085\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Surreal Underworld</strong> <br/>Discover a minimalist and oppressive vision of Yomi, the realm of the dead. Forge ahead on a linear, atmospheric journey where the emptiness of the surroundings sets the tone and conceals the dangers waiting on your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103600/extras/8e949568b5697b889e8fa5ef4f441fcc.poster.avif?t=1786569085\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103600/extras/8e949568b5697b889e8fa5ef4f441fcc.webm?t=1786569085\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103600/extras/8e949568b5697b889e8fa5ef4f441fcc.mp4?t=1786569085\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Yomi no Kuni is an Action Roguelike game where you play as a samurai seeking redemption in a twisted version of the Shinto underworld. Unlock new skills and modify the Death Mark to defeat your enemies.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103600/2bf7dcc32f69daea57c4b4555b7c654762be704e/header.jpg?t=1786569085", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Hack and Slash", "Roguelite", "Dungeon Crawler", "Roguelike", "Isometric"], "developers": "Overdrive Team", "publishers": "Overdrive Team", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4103600", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/huhZNTZ1YGY", "first_seen": 1786485600.0, "review_rank": 121}